  "statement_html": "\tOn considère les points \\(A\\), \\(B\\) et \\(C\\) d'affixes respectives : <br>\t<div class=\"wimscenter\"> \\(z_{A} =\\) \\(i - 3\\), &nbsp;\t\\(z_{B} =\\) \\(2 i - 2\\), &nbsp; et &nbsp;\t\\(z_{C} =\\)\\(- 2 i - 2\\)</div>\t<i>Cet exercice comprend 3 étapes.</i><br>\t1. On cherche à calculer l'angle \\((\\overrightarrow{BC},\\overrightarrow{BA})\\). De quel nombre complexe cet angle est-il un argument ?<br>\t<div class=\"wimscenter\"> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply1\" value=\"1\" /> \\(\\frac{z_{A} - z_{B}}{z_{C} - z_{B}}\\)</label>, <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply1\" value=\"2\" /> \\(\\frac{z_{C} - z_{B}}{z_{A} - z_{B}}\\)</label>, <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply1\" value=\"3\" /> \\(\\frac{z_{A} - z_{C}}{z_{B} - z_{C}}\\)</label>, <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply1\" value=\"4\" /> \\(\\frac{z_{A} - z_{B}}{z_{B} - z_{C}}\\)</label>, <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply1\" value=\"5\" /> \\(\\frac{z_{B} - z_{C}}{z_{A} - z_{C}}\\)</label>, <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply1\" value=\"6\" /> \\(\\frac{z_{C} - z_{A}}{z_{B} - z_{A}}\\)</label>, <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply1\" value=\"7\" /> \\(\\frac{z_{B} - z_{A}}{z_{C} - z_{A}}\\)</label>, <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply1\" value=\"8\" /> \\(\\frac{z_{C} - z_{A}}{z_{A} - z_{B}}\\)</label></div>\t",
